{"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"@property"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"keyword","text":"nonatomic"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"readonly"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"NSArray<id<MLNAnnotation>>","preciseIdentifier":"c:Q$objc(cs)NSArray"},{"kind":"text","text":" * "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"visibleAnnotations"},{"kind":"text","text":";"}],"languages":["occ"],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"]}]},{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The objects in this array must adopt the "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNAnnotation","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" protocol. If no"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"annotations are associated with the map view or if no annotations associated"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with the map view are currently visible, the value of this property is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"metadata":{"role":"symbol","externalID":"c:objc(cs)MLNMapView(py)visibleAnnotations","remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/maplibre\/maplibre-native\/blob\/main\/platform\/ios\/src\/MLNMapView.h#L1890","fileName":"MLNMapView.h"},"fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"visibleAnnotations"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"visibleAnnotations","kind":"identifier"}],"modules":[{"name":"MapLibre"}],"title":"visibleAnnotations","roleHeading":"Instance Property","symbolKind":"property"},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapView\/visibleAnnotations","interfaceLanguage":"occ"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/Ma